TODO.md
general_docs/
superme-docs/
Best-superme-context-practice-and-other-guidance/

# scripts/ ships its suites and gate tooling; what stays local is machine-bound or spent.
/scripts/__pycache__/
/scripts/comment_pass/
/scripts/migrate_phase_rename.py
/scripts/pg_drive.py
/scripts/compaction_bakeoff.py
/scripts/probe_context_floor.py
